/godot-proposals/issues/14513\r\nBased on #117970\r\n\r\nBonus:\r\nThis PR makes Quick Open smarter about type handling by expanding abstract types into concrete selectable ones, then using those resolved types (e.g. `BaseMaterial3D` -> `ORMMaterial3D, StandardMaterial3D`) for filtering and per-type history.\r\n\r\nMore coherent selection behavior when toggling `include_addons`: keep selected otherwise hide.\r\n\r\nDalog title generation now pulls concrete types from current state and builds a clearer multi-type title.\r\n\r\n![85d6cb41-81d6-4497-b2e1-787f8e4a259d](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6f43ffc-87f4-4065-b46b-b6dcfc6179d2)\r\n![3a7b3d7e-d025-4767-9aec-c3a70dc39e7c](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cae4392e-e4ce-4e32-85e1-378dd04e4f40)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://av